      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 152196800094208
    m_Localized: Touch and hold the white circle and move it in any direction and
      the character will move in that direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 152559552864256
    m_Localized: Every 1 second, the character will automatically shoot bullets.
      When destroying an enemy, you will receive some points and have a chance to
      drop power ups
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153267454910464
    m_Localized: This is player health bar, if out of health will lose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153667423739904
    m_Localized: Below the health bar, shaped like the one above, is the button that
      pauses the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153803516321792
    m_Localized: The score will be displayed on the left side of the screen. When
      you kill an enemy, the score will increase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 154385115291648
    m_Localized: On the right side of the screen is the number of lives on earth.
      There are a maximum of 3 lives, if the enemy reaches the bottom of the screen,
      you will lose 1 life, and if you have 0 lives, you will lose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 158736533725184
    m_Localized: 'TotalScore: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2001374265048039426
  - m_Id: 182062496915456
    m_Localized: 'Earth: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2001374265048039426
  - m_Id: 186464242802688
    m_Localized: PLAY AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 186586775199744
    m_Localized: MAIN MENU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188160285122560
    m_Localized: MISSION FAILED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2001374265048039426
  - m_Id: 188363385905152
    m_Localized: You died while protecting the earth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188634971283456
    m_Localized: The earth has been invaded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189127491624960
    m_Localized: 'Score: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2001374265048039426
  - m_Id: 213422783635456
    m_Localized: You protected the earth from invasion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 213664337797120
    m_Localized: MISSION COMPLETED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 213782487146496
    m_Localized: MISSION FAILED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1329731953008640
    m_Localized: Try to eat power up to become stronger, defeat all enemies to win
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2053370658725888
    m_Localized: THE 1ST WAVE WAS DEFEATED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2053614553309184
    m_Localized: WAVE 2 IS COMING !!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2053860842840064
    m_Localized: THE 2ND WAVE WAS DEFEATED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2053966941954048
    m_Localized: FINAL WAVE IS COMING !!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054123334967296
    m_Localized: These are enemy bullets, avoid them to avoid losing your health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2088727093747712
    m_Localized: This is a power up that increases the player's maximum health by
      1 health, up to 6 health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2089619129933824
    m_Localized: This is a power up that receives a shield, the shield will have
      a certain amount of health to block a corresponding amount of damage for the
      player until it is disapear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2090621870579712
    m_Localized: This is a health box power up, when eaten it will restore one health,
      if full health will add 30 points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2091228467601408
    m_Localized: This is a power up that gives extra points, it will give random
      between 10 - 100 points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2092115512565760
    m_Localized: This is an immortal power up, it will help the player not receive
      any damage for 15 seconds and after 15 seconds it will no longer be effective
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2092898140332032
    m_Localized: 'Finally 2 power ups to increase power:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2093597616021504
    m_Localized: This is a power up that can upgrade bullet damage, up to 3 levels
      with 2 - 3 - 4, if the level is maxed out it will add 50 points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2094294109560832
    m_Localized: This is a power up that upgrades shooting ability, allowing players
      to shoot up to 3 bullets in a row at once. If the level is at maximum, it will
      add 70 points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2139647219376128
    m_Localized: BACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
